       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_coding_whf_132'), 3, 'The same shape on a different problem: a payment terminal returns { declined } or { code }. Rule order: a non-empty declined string -> "declined" whatever else is present; a code that is not an integer -> "unknown"; 1000-1999 -> "approved"; 2001 -> "retry"; anything else -> "unknown". So { code: 1500 } is "approved", { code: "1500" } is "unknown", and { declined: "expired", code: 1000 } is "declined".');
